// Title: Kubernetes Secrets Modified or Deleted
// ID: 58d31a75-a4f8-4c40-985b-373d58162ca2
// Status: test
// Level: medium
// Author: kelnage
// Date: 2024-07-11
// Tags: attack.credential-access
// Description: Detects when Kubernetes Secrets are Modified or Deleted.
// Converted by: Sigma Universal SIEM/EDR CLI

(where(objectRef.resource = "secrets") AND (where(verb = "create") OR where(verb = "delete") OR where(verb = "patch") OR where(verb = "replace") OR where(verb = "update")))
